{"src":"en","tgt":"ru","rate":24000,"room_opened_ms_before":1500,"err":"","clip_ms":189600,"events":[{"kind":"hello","type":"hello","lang":"ru","src":"en","rate":24000,"mode":"utterance","edition":"nonprofit","context":true},{"kind":"input","t":9353.905773,"text":"In 1990, it was added to the list of World Heritage Sites in Danger due to the threat of desert sands."},{"kind":"text","t":9912.817955,"text":"В 1990 году оно было включено в список объектов Всемирного наследия под угрозой из-за угрозы наступления пустынных песков."},{"kind":"audio","t":10120.963446,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":10122.283942,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":10123.553748,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":10125.139609,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":10126.775282,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":840},{"kind":"audio","t":10128.590428,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":80,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":10130.063627,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":950},{"kind":"audio","t":10131.413024,"samples":28365,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1040},{"kind":"input","t":18860.915892999998,"text":"If you have watched the movie National Treasure, you may think a treasure map was written on the back of the Declaration of Independence."},{"kind":"text","t":19493.767366,"text":"Если вы смотрели фильм «Сокровище нации», вы могли подумать, что на обратной стороне Декларации независимости была написана карта сокровищ."},{"kind":"audio","t":19690.753455,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":19692.187324,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1040},{"kind":"audio","t":19694.212733999997,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":120,"off":1240},{"kind":"audio","t":19695.487709999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":290,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":19697.455939,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":19698.655193,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":19700.355896999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1300},{"kind":"audio","t":19700.55145,"samples":8582,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":26839.783936,"text":"Children are placed in foster care for a wide variety of reasons that range from neglect to abuse."},{"kind":"text","t":27387.110717,"text":"Детей передают на патронатное воспитание по самым разным причинам: от пренебрежения родительскими обязанностями до жестокого обращения."},{"kind":"audio","t":27497.281949,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":27498.596465,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":27500.435781999997,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":27500.593685,"samples":5349,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":30},{"kind":"audio","t":27502.312089,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":27503.998893,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":27505.612634999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":27505.831288999998,"samples":8972,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":290},{"kind":"input","t":29876.234456,"text":"and even to extortion."},{"kind":"text","t":30026.526115999997,"text":"и даже к вымогательству."},{"kind":"audio","t":30069.882888999997,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":30070.065651999997,"samples":8470,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":120},{"kind":"input","t":40799.598578000005,"text":"Chocamo Valley, Chile's premier climbing destination, known as the Yosemite of South America, with a variety of granite big walls and crags."},{"kind":"text","t":41519.349350000004,"text":"Долина Чокамо, главное место для скалолазания в Чили, известное как Йосемити Южной Америки, с множеством гранитных бигволов и скал."},{"kind":"audio","t":41696.158978,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1090},{"kind":"audio","t":41697.465474000004,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":350,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":41699.171518,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1230},{"kind":"audio","t":41700.917893000005,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":800,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":41702.676878,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":41704.29858,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":41705.899082,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":41706.199318,"samples":9975,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":230},{"kind":"input","t":46505.30103,"text":"Accepted were Aristotle's views on all matters of science, including physiology."},{"kind":"text","t":46830.97192,"text":"Принимались взгляды Аристотеля по всем вопросам науки, включая физиологию."},{"kind":"audio","t":46934.432379000005,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":46935.691574000004,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":46937.324796,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":46938.979679000004,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1250},{"kind":"audio","t":46939.111342000004,"samples":1003,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":54285.049351,"text":"If you're not used to driving on country roads, keep your wits about you. Steep grades, narrow lanes, and sharp curves predominate."},{"kind":"text","t":54693.55804,"text":"Если вы не привыкли ездить по просёлочным дорогам, будьте предельно внимательны. Преобладают крутые подъемы, узкие переулки и резкие повороты."},{"kind":"audio","t":54807.047028,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":54808.301153,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":54809.889424,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":54810.278802,"samples":11201,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":290},{"kind":"audio","t":54812.118679,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":54813.727891,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":54815.386044,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":54816.471535000004,"samples":24018,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":800},{"kind":"input","t":67488.234457,"text":"The presence of the true invisible team, Larson and LaFasto, 1989, page 109, is also a unique component of a virtual team."},{"kind":"text","t":68169.936352,"text":"Наличие истинной невидимой команды (Ларсон и ЛаФасто, 1989, стр. 109) также является уникальным компонентом виртуальной команды."},{"kind":"audio","t":68338.424074,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":68339.751841,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":68341.30904200001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1250},{"kind":"audio","t":68342.920874,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":68344.614267,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":68345.870132,"samples":25356,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":910},{"kind":"audio","t":68347.644478,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":68349.304141,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":68350.922403,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":68351.523005,"samples":15102,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":450},{"kind":"input","t":73011.752374,"text":"After the accident occurred, Gibson was transported to a hospital but died shortly after."},{"kind":"text","t":73449.205778,"text":"После того как произошла авария, Гибсона доставили в больницу, но вскоре он скончался."},{"kind":"audio","t":73568.827309,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":73570.090934,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":73571.67748500001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":73573.242226,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":73574.251907,"samples":22179,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":730},{"kind":"input","t":82787.44192,"text":"Many German baked goods feature almonds, hazelnuts, and other tree nuts. Popular cakes often pair particularly well with a cup of strong coffee."},{"kind":"text","t":83229.247761,"text":"Во многих немецких кондитерских изделиях используются миндаль, фундук и другие древесные орехи. Популярные торты часто особенно хорошо сочетаются с чашкой крепкого кофе."},{"kind":"audio","t":83376.382649,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":83377.727925,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":83379.34914800001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1090},{"kind":"audio","t":83380.89376800001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":190,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":83382.540791,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1210},{"kind":"audio","t":83382.652053,"samples":1950,"rate":24000},{"kind":"audio","t":83384.50394,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1110},{"kind":"audio","t":83386.079252,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":220,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":83387.736065,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":83389.345567,"samples":32099,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1100},{"kind":"input","t":90150.309936,"text":"Needless to say, if you know a Romance language, it will be easier for you to learn Portuguese."},{"kind":"text","t":90633.02588100001,"text":"Само собой разумеется, что если вы знаете какой-либо из романских языков, вам будет легче выучить португальский."},{"kind":"audio","t":90778.50737600001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":90779.769901,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":90781.408413,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":90782.992105,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":660},{"kind":"audio","t":90784.673448,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":100,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":90786.213319,"samples":30650,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1110},{"kind":"input","t":97834.306131,"text":"The pyramid sound and light show is one of the most interesting things in the area for kids."},{"kind":"text","t":98223.19811,"text":"Светозвуковое шоу у пирамид — одно из самых интересных развлечений в этом районе для детей."},{"kind":"audio","t":98339.978023,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98341.374731,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98343.126166,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98344.84143,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98345.669957,"samples":21065,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":690},{"kind":"input","t":103726.411192,"text":"Traffic flow is the study of the movement of individual drivers and vehicles between two points."},{"kind":"text","t":104111.202489,"text":"Транспортный поток — это изучение перемещения отдельных водителей и транспортных средств между двумя точками."},{"kind":"audio","t":104254.848387,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1220},{"kind":"audio","t":104256.055761,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":510,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":104257.710534,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":104259.315216,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":104260.941148,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":104262.254205,"samples":27306,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":940},{"kind":"input","t":106589.835739,"text":"and the interactions they make with one another."},{"kind":"text","t":106752.341302,"text":"и их взаимодействий друг с другом."},{"kind":"audio","t":106805.809446,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":106806.538641,"samples":21566,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":740},{"kind":"input","t":114644.678134,"text":"Australia's Mitchell Gowrie finished 11th in the men's standing Super G Chet's"},{"kind":"text","t":115142.43971800001,"text":"Митчелл Гоури из Австралии занял 11-е место в зачете мужчин в дисциплине супергигант."},{"kind":"audio","t":115248.59034,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":115250.43470700001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":115252.08478,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":115253.713512,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1280},{"kind":"audio","t":115253.820294,"samples":1003,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":121613.698143,"text":"competitor Ulrich Joklin finished 16th in the men's sitting Super G."},{"kind":"text","t":122157.483673,"text":"Спортсмен Ульрих Йоклин занял 16-е место в зачете мужчин в дисциплине супергигант (сидя)."},{"kind":"audio","t":122279.660474,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":122280.999221,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":122282.627443,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":122284.25374500001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":122285.277086,"samples":22179,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":710},{"kind":"input","t":128634.328759,"text":"As referenced, independent studies suggest that Nepalese UN peacekeeping battalion unknowingly brought"},{"kind":"text","t":129132.828838,"text":"Как отмечается, независимые исследования показывают, что непальский миротворческий батальон ООН неосознанно занес"},{"kind":"audio","t":129305.370071,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":210,"off":1220},{"kind":"audio","t":129306.719888,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":310,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":129308.378891,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":129309.982193,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":129311.628686,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":129313.284679,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":710,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":129314.788409,"samples":29647,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1140},{"kind":"input","t":136532.62446899997,"text":"Soon after the outbreak of hostilities, Britain initiated a naval blockade of Germany."},{"kind":"text","t":136871.225097,"text":"Вскоре после начала боевых действий Великобритания установила военно-морскую блокаду Германии."},{"kind":"audio","t":136982.11878299998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":136983.42947899998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":136985.097473,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":136986.734065,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":136987.07817199998,"samples":10755,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":370},{"kind":"input","t":145643.67931099999,"text":"It also attacked anything that entered the water. Even a giant dinosaur such as T-Rex would be no match for it."},{"kind":"text","t":146156.824841,"text":"Она также атаковала всё, что заходило в воду. Даже такой гигантский динозавр, как тираннозавр рекс, не стал бы ему равным противником."},{"kind":"audio","t":146246.57221699998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":146247.840872,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":146248.617698,"samples":17219,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":590},{"kind":"audio","t":146288.756646,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":146290.037242,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":146291.638434,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1050},{"kind":"audio","t":146293.29088699998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":100,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":146293.919589,"samples":15492,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":540},{"kind":"input","t":155037.40347599998,"text":"The use of video recording has led to important discoveries in the interpretation of microexpressions."},{"kind":"text","t":155397.63508399998,"text":"Использование видеозаписи привело к важным открытиям в интерпретации микровыражений."},{"kind":"audio","t":155501.831178,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":155503.191795,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":155504.793457,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":155506.18744399998,"samples":28198,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1030},{"kind":"input","t":159391.118746,"text":"facial movements which last a few milliseconds."},{"kind":"text","t":159648.896426,"text":"мимические движения, которые длятся несколько миллисекунд."},{"kind":"audio","t":159729.406498,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":159730.741674,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":159732.196963,"samples":29758,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1040},{"kind":"input","t":167448.10268399998,"text":"The announcement was made after Trump had a phone conversation with Turkish President Recep Tayyip Erdogan."},{"kind":"text","t":167929.008263,"text":"Об этом было объявлено после телефонного разговора Трампа с президентом Турции Реджепом Тайипом Эрдоганом."},{"kind":"audio","t":168069.662942,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":168071.037689,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":168072.60390999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":168074.197992,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":990},{"kind":"audio","t":168075.97163699998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":168077.27834299998,"samples":27027,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1000},{"kind":"input","t":174921.392477,"text":"These are sometimes crowded family beaches with a good range of shops aligning the shore."},{"kind":"text","t":175278.84485999998,"text":"Иногда это многолюдные семейные пляжи с большим выбором магазинов вдоль берега."},{"kind":"audio","t":175385.07484299998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":175386.45035099998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":175388.05592299998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":175389.716716,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":175389.821478,"samples":5182,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":177075.54755,"text":"I just want to get safe."},{"kind":"text","t":177233.93821199998,"text":"Я просто хочу оказаться в безопасности."},{"kind":"audio","t":177296.23400099998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":177297.54952799997,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1240},{"kind":"audio","t":177297.68472999998,"samples":4959,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":188433.69672399998,"text":"Most of the smaller islands are independent nations or associated with France and known as luxury beach resorts."},{"kind":"text","t":188948.892355,"text":"Большинство из более мелких островов являются независимыми государствами или связаны с Францией и известны как роскошные пляжные курорты."},{"kind":"audio","t":189129.08676099998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":189130.47724799998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":189132.13371099997,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":189133.77600399998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":189135.29649399998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":189136.960707,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":189138.59508,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":189139.09115,"samples":13040,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":320},{"kind":"close","t":199605.50649,"code":1005}]}